  "description": "Step into an enchanting fairytale wonderland with this magical Princess Castle & Fairy Tale SVG & PNG Clipart Bundle! Featuring a beautiful blonde princess in a flowing pink ballgown surrounded by an array of fairytale elements—including majestic pink castles, enchanted royal carriages, sparkling tiaras, magic wands, glass slippers on satin pillows, ornate hand mirrors, necklaces, ballgowns, and tea party accessories—this collection is a dream come true for kids’ crafts and party designs.\nEvery graphic is designed with clean, precise vector paths for effortless cutting and weeding on electronic cutting machines such as Cricut Explore, Maker, Silhouette Cameo, and Brother ScanNCut. The package also includes high-resolution transparent PNG files, making it instantly ready for sublimation printing, direct-to-film transfers, and digital design projects.\nIncluded File Formats:\nSVG – Multi-layer precision cut files compatible with Cricut Design Space, Silhouette Designer Edition, Brother ScanNCut, and laser software.\nPNG – 300 DPI high-resolution transparent background graphics, optimized for sublimation, DTF, DTG printing, and digital mockups.\nEPS – Fully scalable vector format for easy customization, resizing, and color editing in Adobe Illustrator, Inkscape, or CorelDraw.\nPerfect For:\nLittle girl birthday t-shirts, toddler onesies, pajamas, and dress-up tote bags\nPrincess-themed birthday invitations, cupcake toppers, party banners, and favor bags\nSublimation drinkware, personalized water bottles, and ceramic mugs\nNursery wall art prints, framed playroom decor, and growth charts\nScrapbook memory books, planner stickers, reward charts, and hair bow accents\nPlease note: This is an instant digital download product. No physical items will be shipped.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Step into an enchanting fairytale wonderland with this magical Princess Castle &amp; Fairy Tale SVG &amp; PNG Clipart Bundle! Featuring a beautiful blonde princess in a flowing pink ballgown surrounded by an array of fairytale elements—including majestic pink castles, enchanted royal carriages, sparkling tiaras, magic wands, glass slippers on satin pillows, ornate hand mirrors, necklaces, ballgowns, and tea party accessories—this collection is a dream come true for kids’ crafts and party designs.</p>\n<p>Every graphic is designed with clean, precise vector paths for effortless cutting and weeding on electronic cutting machines such as Cricut Explore, Maker, Silhouette Cameo, and Brother ScanNCut. The package also includes high-resolution transparent PNG files, making it instantly ready for sublimation printing, direct-to-film transfers, and digital design projects.</p>\n<p>Included File Formats:</p>\n<p>SVG – Multi-layer precision cut files compatible with Cricut Design Space, Silhouette Designer Edition, Brother ScanNCut, and laser software.</p>\n<p>PNG – 300 DPI high-resolution transparent background graphics, optimized for sublimation, DTF, DTG printing, and digital mockups.</p>\n<p>EPS – Fully scalable vector format for easy customization, resizing, and color editing in Adobe Illustrator, Inkscape, or CorelDraw.</p>\n<p>Perfect For:</p>\n<p>Little girl birthday t-shirts, toddler onesies, pajamas, and dress-up tote bags</p>\n<p>Princess-themed birthday invitations, cupcake toppers, party banners, and favor bags</p>\n<p>Sublimation drinkware, personalized water bottles, and ceramic mugs</p>\n<p>Nursery wall art prints, framed playroom decor, and growth charts</p>\n<p>Scrapbook memory books, planner stickers, reward charts, and hair bow accents</p>\n<p>Please note: This is an instant digital download product. No physical items will be shipped.</p>",
